[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-WEB-009
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Export downloads
STATEMENT: >>>
The export addresses are `<API_URL>/export/pdf/<id>`, `/export/json/<id>`, `/export/gpx/<id>` and
`/export/kml/<id>`, with the report id not URL-encoded. `downloadFile(url, fileName, headers)` fetches the address
(60 s limit), throws `ApiError` with fallback code `download` when the answer is not ok, and otherwise saves the
body as a file named `fileName` through a temporary link, releasing the object URL after 1,000 ms.
`downloadAirframeRecord(label)` fetches `GET /export/airframe/<label>/pdf` with the stored token (60 s limit),
throws `AirframeAuthError` code `airframeNeedsToken` on 401 or 403, `ApiError` code `download` on another
failure, and saves the body as `flightmd_<label>_record.pdf`.
<<<
