[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-WEB-014
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Report fetch on the Next server
STATEMENT: >>>
The server address is `API_URL`, else `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`, else `http://localhost:8000`, with one trailing `/`
removed. `fetchReportOnServer(id)` calls `GET <server>/report/<id URL-encoded>` with `cache: "no-store"` and an
8,000 ms limit and returns: `done` with the report on 200 with a JSON body; `missing` on 404; `failed` on 422 with
the body's string `detail` or null; `pending` on any other status, on a 200 body that is not JSON, and when the
call throws (no connection, time limit).
<<<
