[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-WEB-021
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Log positions and durations
STATEMENT: >>>
`fmtClock(s, decimals = 0)` writes a position in the log as `m:ss` below one hour and `h:mm:ss` from one hour, with
the seconds floored, or written with `decimals` decimals when that is above 0, and a leading `-` for a negative
value. `fmtDuration(s)` rounds to whole seconds and writes `<s> s` below one minute, `<m> min <ss> s` below one hour
and `<h> h <mm> min` from one hour. Both return `DASH` for a missing value.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
