[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-WEB-028
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Recent reports list
STATEMENT: >>>
The recent list is kept under `flightmd.recent` as a JSON array of entries with `id`, `fileName`, `uploadedAt` (ms
since 1970) and the optional `airframeLabel`, `score`, `grade`, `scoreLabel`, `flightStart`, `vehicle`,
`firmware`, `deduplicated`, `contributionId`. `getRecentReports` returns an empty list when the stored value is not
an array and drops entries without a string `id`. `addRecentReport` puts the entry first, removes an older entry
with the same id and keeps at most 20. `updateRecentReport(id, patch)` merges the patch into the entry with that id
and does nothing when there is none. `removeRecentReport(id)` removes it; `clearRecentReports` stores an empty list.
<<<
