[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Unit preference (frontend/lib/units.ts, frontend/components/shared/UnitsToggle.tsx)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-WEB-031
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Unit preference hook
STATEMENT: >>>
`useUnits()` returns `metric` on the server render and the first browser render; after mount it returns the stored
choice when that is a unit system and `metric` otherwise, and reads it again on each window event
`flightmd-units`. `setUnits(system)` stores the choice and sends that event, so every `useUnits` on the page
