[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Finding groups (frontend/lib/groupFindings.ts)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-WEB-041
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Grouping repeated checks
STATEMENT: >>>
`groupFindings(findings)` splits each title at the first `: ` when that occurs after the first character, else at
the first ` — ` (space, U+2014, space) when that occurs after the first character. Findings of one category with
the same text before the split form one bucket; a finding without a split is alone. The output keeps the order in
which each bucket first appears: a bucket of one is the finding itself; a bucket of two or more is a group with
`groupTitle` (the text before the split), the category, `worstSeverity` (lowest in the severity order) and the
findings in their input order.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
