`guessAutopilot(report)` is `px4` when the metadata has `px4_version`, or the firmware version and vehicle type
contain `px4` (case ignored), or the file name ends in `.ulg` or `.ulog` (case ignored). Otherwise it is
`ardupilot` when those contain `ardu`, `copter`, `plane`, `rover` or `sub` (at a word end) or the file name ends
in `.bin`. Otherwise it is `ardupilot` when a change-sheet name starts with `ATC_`, `INS_`, `PSC_`, `MOT_`,
`BATT_` or `EK3_`, then `px4` when one starts with `MC_`, `MPC_`, `EKF2_`, `IMU_` or `COM_`, else null.
`defaultFormat(report)` is `qgc` for `px4` and `missionplanner` otherwise.
