TITLE: QGroundControl text
STATEMENT: >>>
`paramFile(params, "qgc")` is the five lines `# Onboard parameters for Vehicle 1`, `#`, `# FlightMD suggested
changes`, `#`, `# Vehicle-Id Component-Id Name Value Type`, then one row per entry, in the order given and with
none left out: `1`, `1`, the name, `fmtParam` of the suggested value and the type, separated by tabs. The type is 6
(INT32) when the current and the suggested value are both whole numbers and 9 (REAL32) otherwise. Lines end with
LF, the last one included. `paramLine(p, "qgc")` is the name and value separated by a tab. The file name offered is
`flightmd_changes.params`.
