[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-WEB-055
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Metric units and decimals
STATEMENT: >>>
Key metrics have fixed units and decimals: oscillation peaks in `Hz` with 1, normalised amplitudes with 2; vibration
`max_imu_rms` in `m/s²` with 1, `total_clip_count` with 0, `vibration_vs_limit` with 2,
`max_accel_vibration_metric` in `m/s²` with 2, `max_gyro_vibration_metric` in `rad/s` with 3; power `min_vcc_v` and
`vcc_range_v` and battery `sag_per_cell_v` in `V` with 2; `ekf.max_innovation_ratio` with 2; `gps.max_hdop` with 1
and `gps.min_satellites` with 0; `motors.motor_balance_index` with 2; `parameters.anomaly_count` with 0; ascent
`time_to_apogee_s`, `boost_duration_s` and `time_from_apogee_to_deployment_s` in `s` with 1 and `peak_boost_g` in
`g` with 1. Another key has no unit and 0 decimals when its name contains `count`, `satellites` or `num_` or ends
in `_n`, else 2. `format(key, value)` is `fmtNum` with those decimals and unit.
<<<
